  "identifier": "mondo",
  "name": "Mondo Disease Ontology",
  "description": "Unified, continuously updated disease ontology that harmonises and cross-maps terminology from OMIM, Orphanet, the Disease Ontology, NCIt, and others into a single coherent hierarchy with stable identifiers. Widely used for rare-disease research, phenotype-to-disease mapping, and data harmonisation. Maintained by the Monarch Initiative.",
  "url": "https://mondo.monarchinitiative.org/",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo",
